anilla JS\n>   - Initialize TypeScript project\n> - [PENDING] Set up build tooling\n>   - Configure Vite/Next.js build system\n>   - TypeScript configuration (strict mode)\n>   - ESLint and Prettier setup\n> - [PENDING] Set up project structure\n>   - Create src/ directory structure (components/, lib/, types/)\n>   - Configure paths and aliases\n>   - Create package.json with dependencies\n\n### Framework Decisions Needed (from line 606-612):\n\nThe plan requires decisions on:\n1. **Framework**: React/Vite or Next.js?\n2. **State Management**: Built-in React hooks or external library (Zustand, Redux)?\n3. **Styling**: CSS modules, styled-components, or Tailwind CSS?\n4. **Testing**: Jest or Vitest?\n5. **Build Tool**: Vite (recommended) or Next.js?\n\n### Conclusion:\n\nThe project is in the **planning/documentation phase only**. It has:\n- ✅ A git repository initialized\n- ✅ Comprehensive implementation plan\n- ✅ Detailed specifications for all features\n- ❌ No actual code or build system\n- ❌ No framework chosen\n- ❌ No dependencies installed\n\n**Next Step:** Choose a framework and initialize the project with the appropriate build tooling.\n</task_result>","title":"Check for package.json and config","metadata":{"sessionId":"ses_39e72d435ffeTDAWegdt4Ii4lY","model":{"modelID":"glm-4.7","providerID":"zai-coding-plan"},"truncated":false},"time":{"start":1771163167687,"end":1771163191545}}}}
