ent.md`\n   - `grid-interaction.md`\n   - `level-progression.md`\n   - `movement-detection.md`\n   - `phase-management.md`\n   - `scoring-system.md`\n   - `simulation-engine.md`\n   - `ui-overlay.md`\n   - `user-interaction.md`\n\n2. **Implementation Plan** (`IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md`):\n   - Comprehensive 623-line plan with 3 sprints\n   - All items marked as `[PENDING]`\n   - Outlines critical path starting with: Project Setup → Type Definitions → Shared Utilities → Simulation Engine → etc.\n\n3. **Build Automation** (`loop.sh`):\n   - Script for running AI agent iterations\n   - Supports both \"plan\" and \"build\" modes\n\n4. **Agent Configuration**:\n   - `PROMPT_plan.md` - Instructions for planning agents\n   - `PROMPT_build.md` - Instructions for build agents\n   - `AGENTS.md` - Currently empty (for status updates)\n\n---\n\n### Planned Implementation (from IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md)\n\nAccording to the implementation plan, the `src/` directory should eventually contain:\n\n**Libraries (`src/lib/`):**\n- `types/index.ts` - Type definitions\n- `validation.ts` - Validation utilities\n- `logger.ts` - Logging utility\n- `state.ts` - State management utilities\n- `simulation.ts` - Core Game of Life engine\n- `phase.ts` - Phase state machine\n- `interaction.ts` - Mouse/touch handling\n- `flux.ts` - Flux resource system\n- `movement.ts` - Movement detection\n- `scoring.ts` - Scoring system\n- `level.ts` - Level progression\n- `transitions.ts` - Transition animations\n- `audio.ts` - Audio sonification\n\n**Components (`src/components/`):**\n- `CanvasGrid.tsx` - Canvas rendering\n- `GridInteraction.tsx` - Grid interaction handling\n- `IntroOverlay.tsx` - Cinematic intro\n- `GlassHUD.tsx` - Glass effect HUD\n- `SettingsPanel.tsx` - Settings UI\n- `ExpertSettings.tsx` - Expert settings panel\n\n---\n\n### Next Steps Required\n\nThe project needs to start with **Sprint 1, Task 1.1: Project Setup & Build System**:\n- Initialize TypeScript project\n- Choose and set up framework