r shared utilities and components\n- The project has NOT been initialized with any framework yet - the first task must be project setup\n\n## Output:\nProvide a detailed analysis of:\n1. Any gaps or inconsistencies you found between specs and the existing plan\n2. Any missing features from specs\n3. A comprehensive, prioritized implementation plan that covers ALL requirements from ALL specs\n4. Recommendations for the first implementation steps\n\nDo NOT implement anything - only analyze and plan.","subagent_type":"general"},"output":"task_id: ses_39e71ae62ffegrT5n3GHQLXKsl (for resuming to continue this task if needed)\n\n<task_result>\n## Analysis Complete\n\nI've analyzed all 14 specification files and the existing implementation plan, creating a comprehensive update.\n\n### Key Findings:\n\n**Critical Gaps:**\n1. **COUNTDOWN Phase** - Spec defines 4 phases, plan only had 3\n2. **Transition System** - Missing 5-state state machine (PLAYING, FADING_OUT, INTERSTITIAL, FADING_IN, READY)\n3. **UI Components** - Intro overlay, UIToggleButton, Glass HUD, Settings panel incomplete\n4. **Sound Effects** - Missing simulation start, level complete, transition sounds\n5. **Grid Sizes** - Missing specific dimensions (20×30, 40×50, 60×80)\n6. **Phase Guards** - Missing minimum 1 cell rule, input validation\n7. **Browser Tab Handling** - Missing pause during transitions\n\n**Missing Features:** 27 total, including cell preview ghost, cursor states, high score persistence, skip transitions, accessibility, mobile gestures, and more.\n\n### Deliverables Created:\n\n1. **GAP_ANALYSIS.md** - Detailed 500+ line analysis of all gaps, inconsistencies, and missing features\n2. **IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md** - Comprehensive updated plan with:\n   - 6 sprints (expanded from 3)\n   - ~250 tasks (up from ~106)\n   - All requirements from all 14 specs\n   - Proper priorities and dependencies\n   - 6-week timeline\n3. **ANALYSIS_SUMMARY.md** - Executive summary with key findings and recommendations\n\n### Recommendations for First Steps:\n\n1. **Day 1-2**: Project setup + types + simulation engine + phase management (with COUNTDOWN)\n2. **Day 3-4**: Canvas rendering + user interaction + flux management + grid interaction (MVP complete)\n3. **Day 5-7**: Intro overlay + main UI + settings panel\n\nAll files are ready for review. The new plan prioritizes first impressions (intro overlay), ensures proper game flow (4 phases with guards), and includes all polish features from the specifications.\n</task_result>","title":"Analyze specs vs implementation plan","metadata":{"sessionId":"ses_39e71ae62ffegrT5n3GHQLXKsl","model":{"modelID":"glm-4.7","providerID":"zai-coding-plan"},"truncated":false},"time":{"start":1771163242907,"end":1771163429866}}}}
